{"id":"carga","lemma":"carga","pos":"noun","rank":1106,"glosses":["load","burden","cargo"],"ipa":"/ˈkaɾɡa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"cargas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-carga.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es un barco de carga.","en":"It's a cargo ship.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443865","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"boat"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Era una carga para sus padres.","en":"He was a burden to his parents.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},{"g":"father, parent","l":"padre"}]},{"text":"No quería ser una carga.","en":"I didn't want to be a burden.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Entre los cuatro levantaron la carga.","en":"Between the four of them, they picked up the load.","words":[{"g":"between"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"a four-stringed guitar…"},{"g":"to lift","l":"levantar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La carga de riesgo es demasiado grande.","en":"The risk is too great.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"risk"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"too much"},{"g":"big, large"}]}]}